    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE THE LABYRINTH</h2>Ahead are more than two hundred manually created areas from which levels are procedurally generated. Everything is teeming with deadly enemies who want to take your life. Reach the final boss and save the galaxy. Or choose your adventure path and see how long you can survive. Progression system that increases your power and the power of your enemies will during the game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008450/extras/cd1421a13b5daccc0187a9abc166a61e.poster.avif?t=1733813847\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008450/extras/cd1421a13b5daccc0187a9abc166a61e.webm?t=1733813847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008450/extras/cd1421a13b5daccc0187a9abc166a61e.mp4?t=1733813847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIND POWERFUL ITEMS</h2>Each new game will be different from previous ones thanks to collection of over 120 items. The more items you collect, the more interesting their effects will be. You can obtain items from enemies, buy in the store at the level or before starting a new adventure.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008450/extras/afff1dcc4eb2c1023da10e1d04a43976.avif?t=1733813847\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMPLETE QUESTS AND EXPLORE THE UNIVERSE</h2>An ancient race came from the galactic abyss. Their task is to turn the galaxy into their habitat. As you progress, you will encounter infection, anomalies and strange life forms. More than 60 different quests will allow you to get additional benefits and unlock story elements. Go all the way, learn all about your friends and enemies.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008450/extras/69578b60db415702c5ea33df01458d60.avif?t=1733813847\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE NEW TECHNOLOGIES</h2>Get access to new spaceships, each with a unique fighting style. Uncover the secrets of artifacts and unique weapons. Each next walkthrough will allow you to find new items and rewards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Exciting storyline.<br></li><li>Equipment system.<br></li><li>Leveling and research system.<br></li><li>Destructible and interactive environments, traps.<br></li><li>Over 40 weapon variants with different mechanics, 20 active items, 60 passive modifiers.<br></li><li>Procedurally generated levels.</li></ul>",
