img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008450/extras/69578b60db415702c5ea33df01458d60.avif?t=1733813847\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE NEW TECHNOLOGIES</h2>Get access to new spaceships, each with a unique fighting style. Uncover the secrets of artifacts and unique weapons. Each next walkthrough will allow you to find new items and rewards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Exciting storyline.<br></li><li>Equipment system.<br></li><li>Leveling and research system.<br></li><li>Destructible and interactive environments, traps.<br></li><li>Over 40 weapon variants with different mechanics, 20 active items, 60 passive modifiers.<br></li><li>Procedurally generated levels.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An action-adventure roguelike with a bit of RPG tossed in. Shoot, defend, combine found items in an unexpected way. Complete contracts and uncover secrets to defeat the mysterious enemy. Ahead is a labyrinth filled with insidious dangers, anomalies and many rewards.",
